{"3422100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Neon Hyperdrive", "steam_appid": 3422100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4940530], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/e2bb858fc4307138dd5997a0839940c5.poster.avif?t=1787863490\" width=608 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/e2bb858fc4307138dd5997a0839940c5.webm?t=1787863490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/e2bb858fc4307138dd5997a0839940c5.mp4?t=1787863490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of <i>Neon Drive</i> comes the sequel you've been waiting for: <strong>Neon Hyperdrive</strong> is faster, flashier, and louder in every way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/0786b1d836ac621590388c94700148b6.poster.avif?t=1787863490\" width=608 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/0786b1d836ac621590388c94700148b6.webm?t=1787863490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/0786b1d836ac621590388c94700148b6.mp4?t=1787863490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > This is rhythm racing reimagined: drift tight corners, surf through glowing waves, and fly across neon skies in sync with the music. Each level is a playable music video, with cinematic angles, reactive visuals, and catchy music tracks that drive the action. Master multiple vehicles — car, speedboat, and a plane — and discover new ways to dodge obstacles, each tied to rhythm or melody. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/81c32cfb3b131d5819b952ad68213ee8.poster.avif?t=1787863490\" width=608 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/81c32cfb3b131d5819b952ad68213ee8.webm?t=1787863490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/81c32cfb3b131d5819b952ad68213ee8.mp4?t=1787863490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/7169d884650bba48542d89d325c1aa83.poster.avif?t=1787863490\" width=608 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/7169d884650bba48542d89d325c1aa83.webm?t=1787863490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/7169d884650bba48542d89d325c1aa83.mp4?t=1787863490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/bb6cb10dc3fc360a6877fc3b37d6dea9.poster.avif?t=1787863490\" width=608 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/bb6cb10dc3fc360a6877fc3b37d6dea9.webm?t=1787863490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/bb6cb10dc3fc360a6877fc3b37d6dea9.mp4?t=1787863490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ORIGINAL SOUNDTRACK BY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/ca6da3225dc71487f3559304eaa99bf2.avif?t=1787863490\" width=608 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/05a9c453d513de2f48dca28bb549436c.avif?t=1787863490\" width=609 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore surreal worlds across a vast hypergrid, where every scene is packed with detail and every beat shapes what you see and do. With longer levels, more intense challenges, and a soundscape that hits harder than ever, Neon Hyperdrive turns every run into a high-speed, music-fueled trip. If Neon Drive lit the spark, Neon Hyperdrive will launch you into overdri… er… hyperdrive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if all this sounds like too much of a challenge for you, don't worry — there's an <strong>Easy Mode!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/31cc402f6e56fb7de57d793512294777.poster.avif?t=1787863490\" width=608 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/31cc402f6e56fb7de57d793512294777.webm?t=1787863490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/31cc402f6e56fb7de57d793512294777.mp4?t=1787863490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/e2bb858fc4307138dd5997a0839940c5.poster.avif?t=1787863490\" width=608 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/e2bb858fc4307138dd5997a0839940c5.webm?t=1787863490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/e2bb858fc4307138dd5997a0839940c5.mp4?t=1787863490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of <i>Neon Drive</i> comes the sequel you've been waiting for: <strong>Neon Hyperdrive</strong> is faster, flashier, and louder in every way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/0786b1d836ac621590388c94700148b6.poster.avif?t=1787863490\" width=608 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/0786b1d836ac621590388c94700148b6.webm?t=1787863490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/0786b1d836ac621590388c94700148b6.mp4?t=1787863490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > This is rhythm racing reimagined: drift tight corners, surf through glowing waves, and fly across neon skies in sync with the music. Each level is a playable music video, with cinematic angles, reactive visuals, and catchy music tracks that drive the action. Master multiple vehicles — car, speedboat, and a plane — and discover new ways to dodge obstacles, each tied to rhythm or melody. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/81c32cfb3b131d5819b952ad68213ee8.poster.avif?t=1787863490\" width=608 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/81c32cfb3b131d5819b952ad68213ee8.webm?t=1787863490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/81c32cfb3b131d5819b952ad68213ee8.mp4?t=1787863490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/7169d884650bba48542d89d325c1aa83.poster.avif?t=1787863490\" width=608 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/7169d884650bba48542d89d325c1aa83.webm?t=1787863490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/7169d884650bba48542d89d325c1aa83.mp4?t=1787863490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/bb6cb10dc3fc360a6877fc3b37d6dea9.poster.avif?t=1787863490\" width=608 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/bb6cb10dc3fc360a6877fc3b37d6dea9.webm?t=1787863490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422100/extras/bb6cb10dc3fc360a6877fc3b37d6dea9.mp4?t=1